\par\pard\sa200\qc{\f2\fs36\b\cf2 CYBERSHIELD: ZERO-TRUST UEBA & THREAT INTELLIGENCE}\par\pard\sa100
\pard\sa240\qc{\f0\fs22\cf5\i Master Specification, Feasibility Audit, Karpathy Principles & Defense Blueprint}\par\pard\sa120
\pard\sa200{\cf5 ________________________________________________________________________________}\par\pard\sa120
\pard\sb120\sa160\li360\ri360\box\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf6\pad120{\f2\fs21\b\cf2 THE KARPATHY FIRST-PRINCIPLES META-PROMPT}\line{\f0\fs20\cf1 Act as an Elite Principal Cybersecurity Architect, Systems Software Engineer, and AI Researcher embodying Andrej Karpathy's first-principles philosophy: extreme mechanical sympathy (understand every line down to the metal), zero bloated black boxes (pure Python standard library + Flask), mathematical transparency (whiteboard-ready formulas), and ruthless intellectual honesty.}\par
\par\pard\sb240\sa120{\f2\fs28\b\cf1 1. Executive Overview & Continuous Zero-Trust Paradigm}\par\pard\sa80
\pard\sb60\sa100\sl276\slmult1{\f0\fs21\cf1 CyberShield moves beyond traditional perimeter security (the obsolete 'castle-and-moat' model) by implementing Continuous Adaptive Risk and Trust Assessment (CARTA):}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 Continuous Verification:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Identity and session telemetry are continuously scored in real-time.}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 Dynamic Trust Scoring:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Dynamic Trust Score (0-100) that decays with anomaly indicators and recovers with safe behavior.}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 Mathematical Impossible Travel:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Spherical trigonometry calculating great-circle distance and velocity (>800 km/h flags airline anomaly).}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 Deception Technology (Honeytokens):} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Decoy enterprise files that spring an instantaneous zero-trust quarantine upon unauthorized download [MITRE T1204].}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 MITRE ATT&CK Matrix:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Automatic alignment of all logged events to official MITRE tactics (T1110, T1078, T1048, T1204, T1090, T1562).}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 Adaptive Step-Up MFA:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Real-time 6-digit OTP delivery via Gmail SMTP (TLS 587) with resilient console fallback.}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 Automated Quarantine:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Instant account quarantine upon 3 consecutive failed attempts or canary trap execution.}\par
\par\pard\sb240\sa120{\f2\fs28\b\cf1 2. Critical Feasibility Audit & Edge-Case Mitigations}\par\pard\sa80
\pard\sb60\sa100\sl276\slmult1{\f0\fs21\cf1 A rigorous engineering evaluation requires recognizing practical edge cases and proving their mitigations:}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 A. SQLite Write Concurrency:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Under rapid brute-force storms, SQLite could hit write-locks. Mitigation: CyberShield employs short-lived connection lifecycles (connect-commit-close per transaction) with row_factory and WAL-mode readiness.}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 B. Client Time Drift:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Client browser clocks may have local drift. Mitigation: CyberShield correlates client time with server timestamps and enforces a 3-hour tolerance window, only penalizing genuine off-hours logins (22:00 - 06:00).}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 C. IP Spoofing & Anonymizers:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Proxies or VPNs mask true client origins. Mitigation: Ingests X-Forwarded-For, sanitizes commas against header injection, calculates Haversine velocities, and checks Tor/VPN exit node IP prefixes.}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 D. SMTP Failover:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Gmail relay quotas or lack of credentials could stall demos. Mitigation: Intelligent dual-dispatch. If SMTP is unconfigured, passcodes print instantly to the terminal and screen with zero downtime.}\par
\par\pard\sb240\sa120{\f2\fs28\b\cf1 3. The 'Karpathy Principles' Applied to CyberShield}\par\pard\sa80
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 1. Deep Mechanical Sympathy:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Rather than installing 50MB+ libraries like geopy, CyberShield implements the exact Haversine equations directly using Python's native math module in 12 lines. Zero external bloat.}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 2. Whiteboard Transparency:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Every algorithm can be hand-calculated on a whiteboard during technical reviews. Distance = 2R * arcsin(sqrt(a)), Velocity = distance / time, clamped risk sums.}\par
\pard\li720\fi-360\sb40\sa60{\f0\fs21\cf2 \bullet\tab }{\f2\fs21\b\cf1 3. Software 1.0 to 3.0 Progression:} {\f0\fs21\cf1 Software 1.0 (Deterministic heuristic rules & sliding-window) -> Software 2.0 (Isolation Forest anomaly vectors) -> Software 3.0 (Autonomous LLM SOC triage copilot).}\par
\par\pard\sb240\sa120{\f2\fs28\b\cf1 4. Honest Intellectual Self-Declaration}\par\pard\sa80
\pard\sb120\sa160\li360\ri360\box\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf6\pad120{\f2\fs21\b\cf2 HONEST PROJECT BOUNDARIES (RESUME & VIVA DEFENSE)}\line{\f0\fs20\cf1 CyberShield is a functional, end-to-end prototype of a Continuous Adaptive Risk and Trust Assessment (CARTA) platform. It proves the viability of mathematical UEBA, deception tripwires, and adaptive step-up authentication using pure, inspectable Python. It is built with Software 1.0 deterministic heuristics, and is architected to cleanly scale into Software 2.0 statistical models (Isolation Forest) and multi-node databases (PostgreSQL) in production.}\par
